Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.47-rt68 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.47 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.2-rt
  Head SHA1: 48278f957c60246658cc1f17046b704de4b13010


Or to build 3.2.47-rt68 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.47.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.47-rt68.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve



